Package: shiye
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Yuii <yuii@localhost>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Description: RSS and Atom feed reader for TOS 7
 Shiye is a self-hosted feed reader that runs entirely on the NAS.
 It supports RSS 2.0, RSS 1.0, Atom 1.0, OPML import and export, categories,
 unread and starred states, full-text search, scheduled refresh with
 conditional HTTP requests, and a keyboard-friendly three-pane interface.
 .
 Feeds are fetched over HTTP(S) by the application user. Article HTML is
 sanitized on the server before it is stored, remote images are proxied,
 and tracking parameters are removed from links.
